{
  "BK_7000_0100_NAR": "Cereza did not know where faerie \r\nsouls went in this chaotic world,\r\nbut wherever Lukaon wound up,\r\nshe hoped he would find peace.",
  "BK_7000_0080_LUC": "“I'm happy I was able to see your\r\nface...one last time...”",
  "BK_7010_0030_CER": "“That gate will take you \r\nback to Inferno.”",
  "BK_7010_0120_NAR": "A calm returned to Avalon Forest.\r\nAs if to wash away the pain of\r\nthe night, the first rays of dawn\r\nenveloped Cereza, bathing her in\r\ntheir warmth.",
  "BK_7010_0040_CER": "“Go on, it'll close soon...”",
  "BK_7020_0000_CER": "“I did it mother, I'm a witch.\r\nI'm strong, and I'll get stronger.\r\nYou don't need to worry any more.”",
  "BK_7020_0030_CER": "“Mother!”",
  "BK_7020_0040_ROS": "“You have grown into \r\na splendid witch, Cereza.\r\nYou are going to be just fine...”",
  "BK_7000_0170_NAR": "This is the fate that awaits every\r\nUmbra Witch: an eternity wandering\r\nthe depth of Inferno.",
  "BK_7000_0090_MOR": "“Goodnight my son.\r\nSweet dreams...”",
  "BK_7000_0030_NAR": "It was almost time\r\nto say goodbye to Lukaon.\r\n",
  "SM_007020_0000_JEA": "“Looks like you'll be \r\nfine on your own, Cereza.”",
  "BK_7020_0060_NAR": "Meetings and Farewells...\r\nThinking of the promise she made to\r\nher friend, Cereza knew that she \r\nhad gained something irreplaceable.",
  "BK_7010_0020_NAR": "The journey had left the demon\r\ntotally exhausted. Struggling to\r\nkeep his eyes open, he stared\r\npensively at his door home.",
  "BK_7000_0010_LUC": "“Cereza...Cheshire...”",
  "BK_7000_0020_LUC": "“You did the right thing,\r\nstopping my mother.\r\nIt was an honour to meet you both.”",
  "BK_7010_0090_CER": "“I'm going to keep getting stronger,\r\nI promise!”",
  "BK_7010_0010_NAR": "But the portal was already\r\ngrowing unstable. It threatened\r\nto close at any moment.",
  "BK_7020_0050_NAR": "Once a regular nightmare,\r\nafter that day Cereza never\r\nsaw that dream again.",
  "BK_7000_0050_LUC": "“We did Cereza...\r\nAnd for that I am thankful.”",
  "BK_7010_0045_NAR": "Cheshire looked back at Cereza.\r\nHis expression said\r\nwhat they were both thinking:\r\n[FONT:9 ]If I go back you'll be all alone.[FONT:N ]",
  "SM_007010_0000_JEA": "I knew you'd make it.",
  "BK_7010_0100_NAR": "A tremendous sound erupted \r\nfrom the portal. But Cheshire's \r\nvoice cut through the din:\r\n[FONT:9 ]I'd expect nothing less![FONT:N ]",
  "BK_7020_0010_ROS": "“Cereza.”",
  "BK_7000_0040_CER": "“I wish...\r\nWe could have become friends.”",
  "BK_7000_0150_NAR": "The end had come \r\nfor Morgana the witch.",
  "BK_7000_0175_NAR": "Cereza did not look away.\r\nShe watched as Morgana's soul was dragged to the underworld.",
  "BK_7000_0160_NAR": "Her peaceful expression was\r\nreplaced by one of agony.\r\nIt was almost too much to watch.",
  "BK_7010_0050_CER": "“Even after all we've been through\r\nyou're still going to treat me like \r\na kid? Just wait, I'll be strong \r\nenough to summon you myself \r\nin no time.”",
  "BK_7010_0060_CER": "“You just take it easy for awhile, okay?”",
  "BK_7020_0070_NAR": "The night was young.\r\nCereza set off on her next adventure,\r\nthe pale moon lighting her way.",
  "SM_007020_0010_CER": "“Jeanne...thank you.\r\nI'll see you again \r\nwhen this is over.”",
  "BK_7010_0000_NAR": "Cheshire realised that this\r\nunexpected twist of fate had\r\ndelivered exactly what he sought:\r\na door to Inferno lay before him.",
  "BK_7010_0110_CER": "“And you better be one hell of\r\na ferocious demon \r\nnext time we meet!”",
  "SM_007010_0010_JEA": "“Come on, let's go!”",
  "BK_7000_0060_NAR": "Mother and child shared \r\na tender embrace.\r\nThis was the warmth he \r\nhad been dreaming of.",
  "BK_7010_0070_NAR": "Cheshire quietly turned \r\nback towards the portal.",
  "BK_7000_0070_LUC": "“Thank you for always \r\nwatching over me Mother. \r\nYou can rest now...”"
}
